# A named action that connects two accepted implementations writes one integrations row on acceptance.
id: codify-integration
skill: highway-codify
fixture: codify-many-implementations
open: /highway-codify Northwind Restock Alerts Send the weekly restock alert through the Northwind Email Gateway
ask: What would you add, correct, or remove?
say: [accept] Looks good.
ask: Would you like to:
say: [decline] Stop here.
writes: code/**
expect: template code/integrations.md :: codify-integrations.md
expect: row code/integrations.md :: RIde4c6008
expect: template code/*/.highway/features/001-*/codify.md :: codify-record.md
covers: 6b5e2f7efb7c Accepting a proposal that includes an integration writes one row to `code/integrations.md`, and a pair already accepted writes none.
covers: 394212ea3630 A named action skips the suggestion list and opens the proposal for that action.
reaches: draft
reaches: index
